- phase-096 `REPORT.md:57-60` states the intended convention: `time.from_unix` uses the same truncation toward zero as `time.format`, so `time.from_unix(time.unix(t))` names the original date. phase-097’s fractional `time.unix` breaks this for fractional inputs.

